NOTE ON BUNDLED COMPONENTS

This repository redistributes a Node.js runtime binary built by the Termux
project (https://github.com/termux/termux-app), together with its runtime
shared libraries. Those components remain under their own respective licenses:

  - Node.js: MIT License (https://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/main/LICENSE)
  - OpenSSL: Apache License 2.0
  - ICU: Unicode License
